From: pattex67 <33281022+pattex67@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:24:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] Yoshi first mission shaders: constant LEA without carry
 out, negated or with a high source and carry; LDG with a descriptor pair;
 USHF under a UPn guard; SHF.U64.HI; TLD.LZ with a uniform handle (0xf66).
 Shader cache: drop the 100 ms wait (it never caught a program), throttle
 compute retries to 100 ms

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
